{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":26.530000686645508,"text":"A bronze young man from around 340 B.C. who stands loosely and reaches out his right hand, as if he were holding something round between his fingers, perhaps the apple of Paris, perhaps a ball. He was found in 1900 by sponge divers who, while looking for sponges, came across a wreck loaded with statues. He is one of very few Greek bronzes to survive almost complete.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"bronze","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"young","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.2799999713897705},{"word":"man","start":1.2799999713897705,"end":1.600000023841858},{"word":"from","start":1.600000023841858,"end":1.899999976158142},{"word":"around","start":1.899999976158142,"end":2.319999933242798},{"word":"340","start":2.319999933242798,"end":3.4000000953674316},{"word":"B","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.7200000286102295},{"word":"C","start":3.7200000286102295,"end":3.9000000953674316},{"word":"who","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"stands","start":4.619999885559082,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"loosely","start":4.920000076293945,"end":5.340000152587891},{"word":"and","start":5.340000152587891,"end":5.980000019073486},{"word":"reaches","start":5.980000019073486,"end":6.199999809265137},{"word":"out","start":6.199999809265137,"end":6.5},{"word":"his","start":6.5,"end":6.699999809265137},{"word":"right","start":6.699999809265137,"end":7},{"word":"hand","start":7,"end":7.28000020980835},{"word":"as","start":7.78000020980835,"end":7.900000095367432},{"word":"if","start":7.900000095367432,"end":8.0600004196167},{"word":"he","start":8.0600004196167,"end":8.239999771118164},{"word":"were","start":8.239999771118164,"end":8.460000038146973},{"word":"holding","start":8.460000038146973,"end":8.699999809265137},{"word":"something","start":8.699999809265137,"end":9.15999984741211},{"word":"round","start":9.159